---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+12815550199';
---
<Layout title="High Chemical Levels in Pool – Spring, TX Rebalancing" description="Rebalance high chlorine, pH, or other chemicals in your Spring, TX pool. Safe correction for swimmer comfort and equipment protection.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><h1>High Chemical Levels</h1><p>Safely bring chemistry back into the ideal range.</p></div></section>
  <section class="content-section"><div class="container" style="max-width:800px">
    <p>Over-chlorination, high pH, or elevated cyanuric acid can irritate skin and eyes, damage equipment, and make the water uncomfortable. We correct levels carefully without creating new imbalances.</p>
    <h2>Typical Issues</h2>
    <ul><li>Excess free chlorine after heavy shocking</li><li>High pH causing scale and cloudy water</li><li>Elevated cyanuric acid reducing chlorine effectiveness</li><li>High calcium leading to scale on surfaces and heaters</li></ul>
    <p>Professional testing and measured adjustments restore comfort and protect your investment.</p>
    <p style="margin-top:2rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Rebalance My Pool</a></p>
  </div></section>
</Layout>
